                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3859fe49-a96a-37b8-ba57-285b0c79a4fb",
                        "entry_id": "32644ac9-7a0b-378e-835f-7cc2f905f176",
                        "glosses": [
                            "het boos, geprikkeld en geërgerd zijn"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ef5c8d0-6b22-4653-a5a4-c74d31de822b",
                                "sense_id": "3859fe49-a96a-37b8-ba57-285b0c79a4fb",
                                "text": "In de Amsterdamse gemeenteraad is wrevel ontstaan over het ‘Flying Squad’-team van de gemeente. In het team zitten ambtenaren die Amsterdammers stimuleren zo veel mogelijk armoederegelingen aan te vragen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "184a6e8a-1f5f-48ed-977e-9fc7260c824e",
                                "sense_id": "3859fe49-a96a-37b8-ba57-285b0c79a4fb",
                                "text": "Carters eerdere commentaren over Noord-Korea veroorzaakten wrevel in het Witte Huis, die hem vorige maand verzocht zou hebben niet meer over de kwestie te spreken omdat dat Donald Trump zou ondermijnen. Carters zoektocht naar vrede rijmt niet met de harde opstelling van Trump, die meer sancties wil tegen Pyongyang en dreigt met militair ingrijpen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f5321f4a-4bb7-42d1-b548-dea4dedb9e7f",
                                "sense_id": "3859fe49-a96a-37b8-ba57-285b0c79a4fb",
                                "text": "Ook de manier waarop Van Breukelen het bedrijf van zijn vriend Rini Stoutjesdijk binnenloodste in Zeist wekte wrevel. Nederlandse en buitenlandse topclubs (Ajax, PSV, Arsenal en FC Groningen) reageerden woest toen duidelijk werd dat BTSW ongeoorloofd gebruik maakte van hun naam en logo’s op het gebied van coaching en psychologische hulpverlening."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1961983b-7cc8-4970-b80a-5641cb9c765f",
                                "sense_id": "3859fe49-a96a-37b8-ba57-285b0c79a4fb",
                                "text": "Dus zou de waarheidscommissie de wrevel opwekken van Moskou, vervolgde Ludwig. Of beter gezegd, nog meer wrevel opwekken dan al het geval was. En daarmee waren ze bij de cruciale vraag aangekomen: hoe groot was eigenlijk het gevaar voor waar her en der in het Westen over gespeculeerd werd? Dus dat de hervormingspolitiek in bloed zou worden gedrenkt, zoals in Boedapest in 1956?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7747f98b-97be-4515-a466-27dd1d08e999",
                        "source_entry_id": "32644ac9-7a0b-378e-835f-7cc2f905f176",
                        "source_sense_id": "3859fe49-a96a-37b8-ba57-285b0c79a4fb",
                        "target_lang_word": "resentment",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "resentment",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "559c33d6-523b-36c4-8012-e9f9f40336be",
                                        "entry_id": "246d733f-e844-3bed-adc0-560e770bfc77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anger or displeasure stemming from belief that one or one's group has been wronged or betrayed by others; indignation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9a9661d-3dc7-40e7-9bfc-db59cea1f77f",
                                                "sense_id": "559c33d6-523b-36c4-8012-e9f9f40336be",
                                                "text": "Amongst the most violent against him was Mrs. Bennet, whose dislike of his general behaviour, was sharpened into particular resentment, by his having slighted one of her daughters."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62cd1bfe-1381-45e2-ba99-93fa5666badf",
                                                "sense_id": "559c33d6-523b-36c4-8012-e9f9f40336be",
                                                "text": "Younger [Customs] examiners, who, perhaps, have not yet acquired the intuition resulting from years of experience, seem partly responsible for the closer examination of incoming luggage. Not only is this closer scrutiny arousing feelings of resentment among passengers, but it is causing serious delays in the departure of boat trains, many of which have been reaching their destinations two or three hours late."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b755a0a0-de25-494e-81f0-2e36f71556e7",
                                                "sense_id": "559c33d6-523b-36c4-8012-e9f9f40336be",
                                                "text": "“I Love Lisa” opens with one of my favorite underappreciated running jokes from The Simpsons: the passive-aggressive, quietly contentious relationship of radio jocks Bill and Marty, whose mindless happy talk regularly gives way to charged exchanges that betray the simmering resentment and disappointment perpetually lingering just under the surface of their relationship."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac710696-84ae-3fbb-bd4b-6c2b1683980e",
                                        "entry_id": "246d733f-e844-3bed-adc0-560e770bfc77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of holding something in the mind as a subject of contemplation, or of being inclined to reflect upon it; feeling; impression."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8719a194-3dd3-4238-85ee-c5138ef6ff04",
                                                "sense_id": "ac710696-84ae-3fbb-bd4b-6c2b1683980e",
                                                "text": "It is a greater wonder that so many of them die, with so little resentment of their danger."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8550876f-7dd2-4ce3-a34f-b12e9dda425d",
                                                "sense_id": "ac710696-84ae-3fbb-bd4b-6c2b1683980e",
                                                "text": "In my mind it is a ſign of a great deal of natural Integrity and inbred Nobleneſs of ſpirit, that maugre [in spite of] the heavineſs of his Complexion that thus ſtrongly bears him dovvn from apprehending ſo concerning Metaphyſicall Truths, yet he retains ſo vivid reſentments of the more sſolid Morality."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "093c1bab-6c73-3005-bebc-95e759258cc6",
                                        "entry_id": "246d733f-e844-3bed-adc0-560e770bfc77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Satisfaction; gratitude."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2bf52af-0def-420e-aa49-6d0c721fb36b",
                                                "sense_id": "093c1bab-6c73-3005-bebc-95e759258cc6",
                                                "text": "The Council taking notice of the many good services performed by Mr. John Milton […] have thought fit to declare their resentment and good acceptance of the same."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ac88bf6e-de8a-4230-8554-f46058d0c2af",
                        "source_entry_id": "32644ac9-7a0b-378e-835f-7cc2f905f176",
                        "source_sense_id": "3859fe49-a96a-37b8-ba57-285b0c79a4fb",
